{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-1co-5-1","title":"1 Corinthians 5:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CO","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 The incestuous person, 6 is cause rather of shame unto them than of rejoicing. 7 The old leaven is to be purged out. 10 Hienous offenders are to be shamed and avoided.</p>\n<p>reported. 1:11; Ge 37:2; 1Sa 2:24 fornication. 11; 6:9,13,18; Ac 15:20,29; 2Co 12:21; Ga 5:19; Eph 5:3; Col 3:5 1Th 4:7; Re 2:21; 21:8 and. Jer 2:33; Eze 16:47,51,52 that one. Ge 35:22; 49:4; Le 18:8; 20:11; De 22:30; 27:20; 2Sa 16:22; 20:3 1Ch 5:1; Eze 22:10; Am 2:7; 2Co 7:12</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1co-5-2","title":"1 Corinthians 5:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CO","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>ye are. 6; 4:6-8,18 mourned. Nu 25:6; 2Ki 22:19; Ezr 9:2-6; 10:1-6; Ps 119:136; Jer 13:17 Eze 9:4,6; 2Co 7:7,9-11; 12:21 might. 5,7,13; Re 2:20-22</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1co-5-3","title":"1 Corinthians 5:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CO","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>as absent. 2Co 10:1,11; 13:2; Col 2:5; 1Th 2:17 judged. or, determined.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1co-5-4","title":"1 Corinthians 5:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CO","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>the name. Ac 3:6; 4:7-12,30; 16:18; Eph 5:20; Col 3:17 when. Mt 16:19; 18:16-18,20; 28:18,20; Joh 20:23; 2Co 2:9,10; 13:3,10</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1co-5-5","title":"1 Corinthians 5:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CO","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>deliver. 13; Job 2:6; Ps 109:6; 2Co 2:6; 10:6; 13:10; Ac 26:18; 1Ti 1:20 that. 11:32; 2Co 2:7; Ga 6:1,2; 2Th 3:14,15; Jas 5:19,20; 1Jo 5:16 Jude 1:22,23 the day. 1:8; Php 1:6; 2Ti 1:18; 2Pe 3:12</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1co-5-6","title":"1 Corinthians 5:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CO","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>glorying. 2; 3:21; 4:18,19; Jas 4:16 a little. 15:33; Mt 13:33; 16:6-12; Lu 13:21; Ga 5:9; 2Ti 2:17</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1co-5-7","title":"1 Corinthians 5:7","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CO","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":7,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":7},"content":"<p>Purge. 13; Ex 12:15; 13:6,7; Eph 4:22; Col 3:5-9 ye may. 10:17 Christ. 15:3,4; Ex 12:5,6; Isa 53:7-10; Joh 1:29,36; 19:14; Ac 8:32-35 1Pe 1:19,20; Re 5:6-9,12 sacrificed. or, slain.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1co-5-8","title":"1 Corinthians 5:8","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CO","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":8,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":8},"content":"<p>let. Ex 12:15; 13:6; Le 23:6; Nu 28:16,17; De 16:16; Isa 25:6 feast. or, holy day. Ps 42:4; Isa 30:29 not. 1,6; 6:9-11; De 16:3; 2Co 12:21; Eph 4:17-22; 1Pe 4:2 neither. 3:3; Mt 16:6,12; 26:4,5; Mr 8:15; Lu 12:1; Joh 18:28-30; 2Co 12:20 1Pe 2:1,2 but. Jos 24:14; Ps 32:2; Joh 1:47; 2Co 1:12; 8:8; Eph 6:24; 1Jo 3:18-21</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1co-5-9","title":"1 Corinthians 5:9","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CO","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":9,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":9},"content":"<p>not. 2,7; Ps 1:1,2; Pr 9:6; 2Co 6:14,17; Eph 5:11; 2Th 3:14</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1co-5-10","title":"1 Corinthians 5:10","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CO","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":10,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":10},"content":"<p>altogether. 10:27 of this. 1:20; Joh 8:23; 15:19; 17:6,9,15,16; 2Co 4:4; Eph 2:2; 1Jo 4:5,7 for. Mt 5:14-16; Joh 17:15; Php 2:15; 1Jo 5:19; Re 12:9</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1co-5-11","title":"1 Corinthians 5:11","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CO","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":11,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":11},"content":"<p>called. 6:6; 7:12,15; 8:11; Mt 18:17; Ac 9:17; Ro 16:17; 2Th 3:6,14; 2Jo 1:10 fornicator. 1-9,10; Ps 50:16-21; 2Co 12:20,21; Ga 5:19-21; 1Th 4:3-8; Re 2:14 Re 2:20; 21:8; 22:15 or covetous. Ps 10:3; Mr 7:21-23; Lu 12:15-31; Eph 5:5; Col 3:5; 1Ti 3:3; 6:9,10 2Pe 2:14,15 or an idolater. 10:7,8,14,18-22 or a railer. 6:10; Ps 101:5 or a drunkard. 11:21; Mt 24:49-51; Lu 12:45,46; 21:34; Ro 13:13; Ga 2:12; Eph 5:18 1Th 5:7,8 or an extortioner. Eze 22:12; Mt 23:25; Lu 18:11 with. 13; Mt 18:17; Ro 16:17; 2Th 3:6,14; 1Ti 6:5; 2Jo 1:10</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1co-5-12","title":"1 Corinthians 5:12","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CO","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":12,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":12},"content":"<p>what. Lu 12:14; Joh 18:36 them. Mr 4:11; Col 4:5; 1Th 4:12; 1Ti 3:7 do not. 6:1-5</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1co-5-13","title":"1 Corinthians 5:13","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CO","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":13,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":13},"content":"<p>God. Ps 50:6; Ac 17:31; Ro 2:16; Heb 13:4; 2Pe 2:9 Therefore. 1,5,7; De 13:5; 17:7; 21:21; 22:21,22,24; Ec 9:18; Mt 18:17</p>"}]}